      "source": "Base class for the standard set of <a href=\"Layers.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.loader.tools\"><code>Layers</code></a>. Defines the following layers:\n<ol>\n<li>\"dependencies\" - For non snapshot dependencies</li>\n<li>\"spring-boot-loader\" - For classes from <code>spring-boot-loader</code> used to launch a\nuber jar</li>\n<li>\"snapshot-dependencies\" - For snapshot dependencies</li>\n<li>\"application\" - For application classes and resources</li>\n</ol>",
      "translation": "标准<a href=\"Layers.html\" title=\"interface in org.springframework.boot.loader.tools\"><code>Layers</code></a>集合的基类。定义以下层：\n<ol>\n<li>\"dependencies\" - 用于非快照依赖项</li>\n<li>\"spring-boot-loader\" - 用于启动 uber jar 的来自 <code>spring-boot-loader</code> 的类</li>\n<li>\"snapshot-dependencies\" - 用于快照依赖项</li>\n<li>\"application\" - 用于应用程序类和资源</li>\n</ol>",
